abstract: "Educational Course Generator: a Python and local Ollama pipeline that turns one YAML config into a full course — outline JSON, full-length lectures, labs, study notes, Mermaid diagrams, assessments and a generated static website. A no-mocks test suite, with --no-interactive mode for CI."
